  "rewrites": {
   "13": {
    "original": "Bomba said the Citizens Manifesto would wrangle towards pushing for the establishment of an official Truth and Justice Commission and Truth Reconciliation Commission to dispense justice and help squash poverty and political intolerance.",
    "rewrite": "Bomba stated that the Citizens Manifesto aims to lead efforts toward establishing an official Truth and Justice Commission and Truth Reconciliation Commission in order to dispense justice and reduce poverty and political intolerance."
   },
   "4": {
    "original": "Citizens Manifesto is a grouping of concerned civil society organisations which formed in February 2018 to challenge the alleged human rights violations taking place at the time under the auspices of the Mnangagwa led government.",
    "rewrite": "Citizens Manifesto is a coalition of conscientious civil society organizations that came together in February 2018 to counter what they perceived as human rights abuses under the Mnangagwa-led government."
   },
   "5": {
    "original": "Bomba dismissed proposals to have another Commission of Inquiry to look into the Beitbridge incident characterised by people getting into chaos due to limited space for shopping and to transact business.",
    "rewrite": "Bomba rejected suggestions for another Commission of Inquiry to investigate the Beitbridge incident, which was marked by disorder resulting from insufficient space for trading and commerce."
   },
   "6": {
    "original": "No fewer than 25 people were reportedly killed by a partisan faction of the Police Service after a window of the Beitbridge border post was smashed and a youthful crowd came in from South Africa.",
    "rewrite": "No fewer than 25 individuals reportedly died at the hands of a police-associated militant group after South African youth stormed a window of the Beitbridge border post."
   },
   "16": {
    "original": "State of Emergency: Film's message is one we don't...",
    "rewrite": "State of Emergency: The film's message is one that we should not overlook."
   },
   "7": {
    "original": "The incident is laughter by many three months on.",
    "rewrite": "Three months later, many regard the incident as a source of laughter."
   },
   "10": {
    "original": "He said the Commission of Inquiry was not fully representative of the general human condition in Zimbabwe and this was bound to cause a split among citizens who believe they were not well represented.",
    "rewrite": "He stated that the Commission of Inquiry did not adequately reflect the general human condition in Zimbabwe, which was likely to lead to a division among citizens who felt they were not properly represented."
   }
  },
  "final_span": "channels that keep it going and let the healing continue.\"\nHe added: \"It can't just be a process then it becomes of little use. We are not saying we don't want to hear that the commission has done its work. It is just that let there be a process at this time that does justice to the tragedy and also let the healing continue.\"\nCitizens Manifesto is a coalition of conscientious civil society organizations that came together in February 2018 to counter what they perceived as human rights abuses under the Mnangagwa-led government.\nBomba rejected suggestions for another Commission of Inquiry to investigate the Beitbridge incident, which was marked by disorder resulting from insufficient space for trading and commerce.\nNo fewer than 25 individuals reportedly died at the hands of a police-associated militant group after South African youth stormed a window of the Beitbridge border post. Three months later, many regard the incident as a source of laughter.\n\"The commission of inquiry what has done, I don't think will bring solace. We need to have a process that actually resolves this matter; that is transformed.\"\nHe stated that the Commission of Inquiry did not adequately reflect the general human condition in Zimbabwe, which was likely to lead to a division among citizens who felt they were not properly represented.\n\"There are conspicuous gaps in how it conducted its work. But this is no longer a CoI (Commission of Inquiry) of the general populous, but a private process of those who are responsible for the commission of inquiry.\"\nBomba stated that the Citizens Manifesto aims to lead efforts toward establishing an official Truth and Justice Commission and Truth Reconciliation Commission in order to dispense justice and reduce poverty and political intolerance.\n\"We are moving away from the police state. We are moving away from authoritarian conditions which we are stuck with for too long\u2026 We are committed towards seeing things change and plunge into a just, democratic set up that is something better suited for the general population.\"\nState of Emergency: The film's message is one that we should not overlook.\nBey",
  "break_point": null
 },
